&lt;p&gt;   03&sol;2010 - This section of the NCD Manual was repealed February 22, 2010, as a result of section 144 of the Medicare Improvements for Patients and Providers Act. Instead, refer to Pub. 100-04, chapter 32, section 140. Effective date: 02&sol;22&sol;2010. Implementation date: 04&sol;05&sol;2010. (&lt;a href=&quot;https:&sol;&sol;www.cms.gov&sol;Regulations-and-Guidance&sol;Guidance&sol;Transmittals&sol;Downloads&sol;R116NCD.pdf&quot;&gt;TN 116&lt;&sol;a&gt;) CR6855&lt;&sol;p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;   04&sol;2006 - The NCD Manual now includes a comprehensive description of the services that must be provided as part of a comprehensive cardiac rehabilitation program, extends the window of time during which the services must be provided and restructures the language for clarity. Effective date: 03&sol;22&sol;2006. Implementation date: 06&sol;21&sol;2006. (&lt;a href=&quot;https:&sol;&sol;www.cms.gov&sol;Regulations-and-Guidance&sol;Guidance&sol;Transmittals&sol;Downloads&sol;R52NCD.pdf&quot;&gt;TN 52&lt;&sol;a&gt;) CR4149&lt;&sol;p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;   08&sol;1989 - Clarified term &quot;direct supervision&quot; to mean a physician must be immediately available and accessible but not required to be physicially present in excercise room itself.  Effective date NA. (TN 41)&lt;&sol;p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;   10&sol;1985 - Clarified reimbursement limitation applied to freestanding clinics and coverage policy for physicial and occupational therapy. Effective date NA. (TN 2)&lt;&sol;p&gt;
